usage: replay_pg_certificate.py [-h] --source-root SOURCE_ROOT [--input INPUT]
                                [--candidate CANDIDATE] [--cache CACHE]
                                --output OUTPUT [--namespace NAMESPACE]
                                [--expected-sha256 EXPECTED_SHA256]
                                [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                                {dependencies,build,recover,verify}

Relocatable PG2 certificate consumer. Recovery needs Python's standard library
only. Numerical capture is separate. Existing hash-locked archive tools are
unchanged.

positional arguments:
  {dependencies,build,recover,verify}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --source-root SOURCE_ROOT
  --input INPUT
  --candidate CANDIDATE
  --cache CACHE
  --output OUTPUT
  --namespace NAMESPACE
  --expected-sha256 EXPECTED_SHA256
  --timeout TIMEOUT
